{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Backrooms Deluxe 2 is a spin on The Backrooms Deluxe with new features such as:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modifiers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match positive and negative effects that give you more or less Deluxe Coins at the end of your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Much better multiplayer replication</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game has been rewritten to support a much more seamless multiplayer experience.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Achievements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has received more achievements, as well as support for non-Steam achievements (only in the game but don't affect Steam progression) for harder challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the original game, permadeath has been added, which adds a new element of challenge as well as being able to earn Deluxe Coins without having to do a full run every time. All players have to die for the run to end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You can't jump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066790/e696515dee5b6444b4c287d07a4d5a40e26f8fa5.jpg"},{"name":"Oh boy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066790/c973d03f682f64c46f673c3c0bc485db0a71c865.jpg"},{"name":"Empty Parking Lot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066790/ce757379041057d9f13b565b793d92b1af87537d.jpg"},{"name":"Dreamer's Pipes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066790/ce71b1191036cb60438be3e57da00654600929f5.jpg"},{"name":"Dreamer's Pools","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066790/d684f8d63a6b2b47274ec04947ada2af5af1536a.jpg"},{"name":"Office Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066790/4080153c13a127b4